OL,3,AUS backs Elon Musk's bid to overturn
OL,4,AbB,120m EU fine against X
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US government is seeking to join
OL,7,FElon Musk's legal challenge to overturn
OL,8,Fa bB,120m (#105m) EU fine against X
OL,9,Fover its blue tick badges.
OL,11,FIn December 2025, the European
OL,12,FCommission said the platform "deceives
OL,13,Fusers" by allowing people to pay for a
OL,14,Fblue verified check mark, because it is
OL,15,Fnot "meaningfully verifying" who is
OL,16,Fbehind the account.
OL,18,FBut US Assistant Attorney General Brett
OL,19,FA. Shumate said on Thursday that the
OL,20,Fcommission had "inappropriately
OL,21,Fattempted" to expand its reach to
OL,22,FAmerican companies outside its control.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
